    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Predictive autoscaler \u00b7 live comparison",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Blue: hybrid predictive \u00b7 Green: seasonal only \u00b7 Orange: reactive \u00b7 Purple: KEDA**\n\nAll four apps receive the same daily simulated traffic schedule. Traffic is **requests/minute**; capacity is **Ready replicas**. Forecast curves below are shown at the time they were observed and refer to future targets\u2014not accuracy scores against traffic at the same chart time. Missing observations remain gaps. **Development observation; formal scoring has not started.**"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Observed traffic \u00b7 RPM",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(istio_requests_total{reporter=\"destination\",destination_workload=\"nginx-test\",destination_workload_namespace=\"demo\"}[1m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "Observed",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "",
